  "changes": [
    "Persist the authenticated Risk principal, claim and exact queued CTP binding before native dispatch; retain unresolved claims on uncertainty.",
    "Require the exact bridge and shared cancel Risk journal in the runtime; close its writer fence after native stop and callback drain.",
    "Drain preparation audit callbacks through the existing owner before READY without relaxing Store ingress fencing.",
